box, it's an amazing opportunity
to ask her questions.

00:30:00.830 --> 00:30:03.980
If we don't see any at the moment,
which I don't see any specific to Beth,

00:30:03.980 --> 00:30:06.850
we'll have some time at the end for
the Q&amp;A for her to answer.

00:30:06.850 --> 00:30:09.860
So please don't be shy about
submitting those questions.

